# Force LF line endings in the repo and in every checkout, on every OS.
# Git on Windows (system gitconfig defaults to core.autocrlf=true) would otherwise
# rewrite this to CRLF in the working tree, which makes `prettier --check .` fail
# locally even though the blob in git is correct. Pinning here is the only knob
# that works across Linux, macOS and Windows — and it is the documented reason
# for .editorconfig's `end_of_line = lf`.
#
# Reference: https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes#_setting-line-ending-handling
* text=auto eol=lf
